      "width": 344,
      "height": 72,
      "text": "② CONTROLLER AGENT\n─────────────────\n• Spawns 1 worker per stock (parallel)\n• Polls /tmp/futu_multi/results/ for .result.json\n• Exponential backoff: 10s → 20s → 40s\n• Circuit breaker: 3 failures → 10 min cooldown\n• Partial results on timeout",
      "originalText": "② CONTROLLER AGENT\n─────────────────\n• Spawns 1 worker per stock (parallel)\n• Polls /tmp/futu_multi/results/ for .result.json\n• Exponential backoff: 10s → 20s → 40s\n• Circuit breaker: 3 failures → 10 min cooldown\n• Partial results on timeout",
